# FTUE Current Flow

Mermaid map of the **actual** first-time path as implemented in code (2026-08-17).  
Does not invent branches that do not exist.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  subgraph LAUNCH["LAUNCH"]
    A[Title mural<br/>CapitalOpeningIntro] -->|Choose your Voyager| B[Cast select<br/>BootCastSelect]
    A -.->|Skip mural sweep| B
    B -->|Continue to Ashore Teach| C{Ashore Teach<br/>5 chambers}
  end

  subgraph ASHORE["ASHORE CHAMBER-00 — tutorial-only"]
    C --> C1[Fantasy: poke organ toy]
    C1 --> C2[Walk: claim glowing rings]
    C2 --> C3[Talk: near + E]
    C3 --> C4[Dock: board Cove painting]
    C4 --> C5[Ready / Launch copy]
    C -.->|Leave · Esc skip all| D
    C5 --> D[Carpet opening flight<br/>CarpetOpeningIntro]
  end

  subgraph HARBOR_MEET["HARBOR — first meet"]
    D --> E[Land Harbor<br/>hubGuidedIntro = meet_guide]
    E --> F[Quiet chrome<br/>Piggy presence]
    F --> G{Talk Piggy?}
    G -->|talked_guide| H[to_dock<br/>Board Carpet CTA]
    G -.->|opened_map bypass| I[guided done]
    H -->|opened_map| I
  end

  subgraph COVE["COVE — live chapter"]
    I --> J[Travel map<br/>spine only · Paycheck locked]
    J --> K[Enter Coincraft Cove]
    K --> L[q_cc_first_coins<br/>Penny → pouch → Coin Sort]
    L --> M[Alma foreshadow]
    M --> N[Keeper Kira Take]
    N -->|Maybe later| M
    N -->|Jar or Treat<br/>setIrreversible + addScar| O[FIRST DECISION]
  end

  subgraph LOOP["SIGNATURE LOOP CLOSE"]
    O --> P[Take hush cinema<br/>take_mark]
    P --> Q[Carpet home CTA]
    Q --> R[Harbor · chapter quiet]
    R --> S[Scar spectacle<br/>harbor_felt]
    S --> T{Share / Witness<br/>optional}
    T --> U[Quiet homecoming<br/>Talk Piggy]
    U --> V[FIRST COMPLETE CORE LOOP<br/>Cove Change complete]
  end

  subgraph FREE["UNGUIDED → FREE PLAY"]
    V --> W[Paycheck unlocks]
    V --> X[Side shores unlock]
    V --> Y[Arcade / Studio / Ritual magnets]
    W --> Z[FIRST UNGUIDED DECISION<br/>pick next painting]
    X --> Z
    Y --> Z
    Z --> AA[FREE PLAY]
  end

  style O fill:#f4b942,stroke:#1c1917,color:#1c1917
  style V fill:#f4b942,stroke:#1c1917,color:#1c1917
  style Z fill:#7dd3fc,stroke:#1c1917,color:#1c1917
  style AA fill:#86efac,stroke:#1c1917,color:#1c1917
```

## Macro stage anchors

| Stage | Node(s) |
|-------|---------|
| LAUNCH | A → B |
| FIRST CONTROL | C2 (Walk rings); if Ashore skipped, first Harbor walk |
| FIRST MEANINGFUL ACTION | C3 or G (Talk) |
| FIRST DECISION | O (Kira Take) |
| FIRST CONSEQUENCE | P → R (hush + quiet) |
| FIRST REWARD | jar item + spectacle + Piggy homecoming |
| FIRST COMPLETE CORE LOOP | V (`q_cc_save_or_spend` completed) |
| FIRST UNGUIDED DECISION | Z |
| FREE PLAY | AA |

## Critical gates (code)

| Gate | Condition |
|------|-----------|
| `meet_guide` | Carpet boot / default guided intro |
| `to_dock` | After `talked_guide` |
| `done` | After `opened_map` (also from `meet_guide`) |
| Paycheck / side shores locked | `!hasCompletedCoveChange(save)` |
| Cove Change | `questStatus.q_cc_save_or_spend.completed` |
| Chapter quiet scars | Spine plaques (`cove_` / `pp_` / `credit_`) via `scarTriggersChapterQuiet` |

